    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "With the lemma in hand, the characterization of residual subspaces is as follows. Proposition 12. A subspace J ∈ J is residual if and only if"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 26,
